  "prefLabel": "Den 101.26 Prescription",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.26 “Prescription” means a verbal, written, facsimile, or electronically transmitted order for medications for self-administration by an individual patient.\n\nSource. #14140, eff 1-31-25",
